# Discovery & Knowledge Graph

- KG is SoT: write `entity` / `relation` first; Markdown artifacts are derived
- MVP entity types: Project, Message, Requirement, Decision, Task, Artifact, Risk
- MVP relations: derived_from, decides, implements, blocks, related_to
- Modes must not freely scan the whole DB later — prefer a context builder
- Discovery adapts to customer IT literacy; one clear question at a time when possible
- Voice transcripts are normal Messages (`kind=VOICE`) after STT
- Canonical English in stored knowledge; customer replies may be localized
- Product type hints live in `templates/`; do not invent new product types ad hoc
- Blocking ambiguity → `WAITING_OWNER` / HumanDecisionRequired, not silent defaults
